 "Adobe Express - file.png", "id": "880012964941330", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_880012968274663_4142236958427032935_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yj9t9mpcsTcQ7kNvwGd5-KQ&_nc_oc=AdpV--V5V_ATe5HANx3MVXsIzRkzSfrlaAGmVgxpo0MSb8TDT_NTXXNaYOCeWzQ4_E4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJk1AdM5xa7qSo1Eh-iV_qXlbZdhuFlLXfRfs4Y90K_dg&oe=6ABE7CF6"}, "display_name": "Spymaster", "keywords": ["spy", "master", "time", "physics"], "long_description": "Protocore threatens the world, and only the elite agents of NODE can stop this dangerous corporation's plans. Take on the roles of Agent Mulligan, TIC and OSCR to execute high-risk missions using their secret weapon, the C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., becoming the ultimate **Spymaster!**\n\n\n\u200e\n\n\n**Rewind Time**\n\nManipulate time using the C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., refining each step, each decision to conduct the perfect mission.\n\n{1968748060384564}\n\n\u200e\n\n**Unbroken Momentum**\n\nRun, climb, slide, zipline and shoot your way to safety.\n\n{934506685620409}\n\n\u200e\n\n**Become an Elite Agent**\n\n- Three Spies - Each with their own unique gameplay traits\n- Dynamic Missions - No two missions are alike, from defusing bombs to poisoning villains, each becomes more challenging, requiring a different approach \n- Varied Gameplay - Solve puzzles, shoot bad guys, infiltrate secure locations and jump into moving helicopters!\n\n\n\n\n\u200e\n\n**Early Access**\n\nSpymaster is in active development, refining its gameplay and continuing to expand its content throughout Early Access.", "short_description": "Infiltrate Protocore, a global corporation with plans that threaten the world. Command three agents with unique skills, manipulate time using the C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., and combine action and puzzles in immersive VR missions to become a Spymaster !"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/1e06831f-b759-4